---
title: "2 · Services & Packages"
description: Keep the catalog of services and packages, their prices and their contract wording up to date.
sidebar:
  order: 3
  label: "2 · Services & Packages"
---

**Who:** department heads (their own department) and tenant admins (all departments). **Where:** **CRM** › **Catalog** › **Services & Packages**.

The list shows each item's department, regions and price, and which contract texts are still missing.

{% screenshot id="crm/catalog-list" caption="The Services & Packages list." /%}

## Edit a service

{% steps %}

1. Select a service to edit it.
2. Under **Regions and prices**, set the reference price for each country.
3. Under **Contract text**, write the **Description** (required, one point on each line) and the optional **Conditions** for each country and language. The right side shows how the text will read in the contract.
4. Select **Save changes**.

{% /steps %}

Contracts generated after the save use the new text. Contracts that were already generated keep their text.

{% screenshot id="crm/catalog-service-edit" caption="Editing a service: prices and contract text." /%}

{% aside type="caution" title="Missing text stops generation" %}
If a service picked for a contract has no description for the contract's country and language, generation stops and names the service.
{% /aside %}
